Voice engine
The optional Kokoro voice uses sherpa-onnx (Apache License 2.0) and
ONNX Runtime. Those libraries are in app/src/main/jniLibs. The Kokoro
model is not in the app; it is downloaded only if that voice is chosen.
See app/src/main/assets/licenses/sherpa-onnx.txt.
